WEBVTT

00:21.855 --> 00:23.023
Hi, Mom.

00:32.532 --> 00:33.742
[Sunok exhales]

00:35.744 --> 00:37.162
Well, if you're calling me that...

00:39.039 --> 00:41.542
...then I guess I really must be dying.

00:43.043 --> 00:46.046
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

00:51.969 --> 00:53.387
The surgery went well.

00:54.388 --> 00:56.848
You're all right.
You'll be okay.

00:58.058 --> 00:59.726
You're not a very good liar.

01:01.520 --> 01:03.605
Just like someone else I know.

01:04.439 --> 01:06.233
I'm looking into other hospitals.

01:07.401 --> 01:10.112
We'll transfer you,
redo the surgery,

01:10.195 --> 01:11.655
with the best doctor.

01:12.781 --> 01:14.032
Stop it.

01:16.493 --> 01:18.036
There's no point, really.

01:18.620 --> 01:20.372
It's been a miserable life.

01:23.083 --> 01:24.167
[exhales]

01:24.251 --> 01:25.460
It's time now.

01:26.670 --> 01:27.713
[Sunok] You should go.

01:29.214 --> 01:32.092
So I can rest in peace.

01:34.011 --> 01:36.221
Why does it matter if I'm here?

01:36.930 --> 01:41.059
Staying with me will only
make things harder for you.

01:41.143 --> 01:42.603
I know that.

01:44.187 --> 01:46.023
I really hated my life here.

01:47.649 --> 01:49.443
And I resented you a lot, too.

01:51.445 --> 01:52.446
[Heeju inhales]

01:52.988 --> 01:56.408
[Heeju] It hurt every time you called me
a luckless brat

01:56.491 --> 01:58.910
or told me nothing will ever work out.

02:00.203 --> 02:01.872
Just give up and live with it.

02:03.874 --> 02:05.709
Just hearing you say those things...

02:07.961 --> 02:10.297
...made it impossible to even dream.

02:12.257 --> 02:13.508
But I realized...

02:14.343 --> 02:16.428
...that's just how you had
to live your life.

02:18.972 --> 02:21.808
[Heeju] And that's why I ran because
I didn't want to live like you.

02:23.352 --> 02:24.603
I thought that maybe...

02:26.563 --> 02:28.315
...if I just ran far enough...

02:29.858 --> 02:32.736
...I could find a way out of that long,
dark tunnel.

02:34.321 --> 02:35.947
[Heeju inhales]

02:36.990 --> 02:38.825
But no matter how far I ran...

02:38.909 --> 02:41.244
[Heeju inhales and exhales deeply]

02:42.120 --> 02:43.330
...there was no end.

02:45.457 --> 02:48.210
That's when I realized I wasn't in
a tunnel at all.

02:51.963 --> 02:53.590
I was in a mine shaft.

02:55.842 --> 02:57.552
[Heeju] And if I kept going...

02:59.805 --> 03:01.765
...there was only a dead end.

03:04.142 --> 03:06.103
[inhales and exhales sharply]

03:06.186 --> 03:07.187
[sniffs]

03:07.938 --> 03:10.524
Then some man showed up
and offered me his hand.

03:11.483 --> 03:13.276
He helped me get out of there.

03:15.612 --> 03:17.572
Everything was so bright.

03:19.032 --> 03:22.119
[Heeju] I was blinded by him.
He was all I could see.

03:24.204 --> 03:25.539
Funny, isn't it?

03:25.622 --> 03:27.416
I thought I was different.

03:27.916 --> 03:29.960
But I relied on a man
just like you.

03:31.044 --> 03:32.295
[inhales]

03:32.379 --> 03:34.005
All I ever wanted...

03:34.881 --> 03:37.259
...was for your life
to turn out differently.

03:40.470 --> 03:42.848
[Heeju] They say daughters
take after their mothers.

03:43.432 --> 03:44.683
[Sunok] Don't say that.

03:46.184 --> 03:47.894
That's exactly why...

03:49.438 --> 03:51.773
...I never wanted you
to call me Mom.

04:02.742 --> 04:03.952
[inhales]

04:05.036 --> 04:06.913
Will you tell me what my father was like?

04:08.874 --> 04:10.041
[Sunok] Why?

04:10.125 --> 04:11.960
You've never asked about him.

04:13.003 --> 04:14.212
[Heeju] I know.

04:15.839 --> 04:17.340
I guess I'm just curious...

04:18.175 --> 04:20.635
...now that I might never
have another chance to ask.

04:21.678 --> 04:23.847
He was a poor man.

04:24.973 --> 04:26.057
[sniffles]

04:26.808 --> 04:28.351
And you picked him?

04:29.227 --> 04:30.520
I'm surprised.

04:31.730 --> 04:32.814
I know.

04:36.026 --> 04:38.403
Out of all those men I was with...

04:40.197 --> 04:43.200
...he was the only one
I truly gave my heart to.

04:46.411 --> 04:47.579
[Heeju] What?

04:48.079 --> 04:49.581
Was he your first love?

04:50.624 --> 04:51.666
[Sunok laughs]

04:53.835 --> 04:55.170
I guess.

04:57.380 --> 04:59.341
He was so handsome.
STYLE
::cue()

05:02.385 --> 05:04.221
One day when I was younger...

05:04.930 --> 05:07.140
...there was a fight at work.

05:07.933 --> 05:09.684
[Sunok] He showed up in his uniform.

05:10.310 --> 05:12.771
He swept me into his arms
and saved me.

05:13.980 --> 05:15.982
He just seemed so cool.

05:18.527 --> 05:19.903
[Sunok] It felt like...

05:21.530 --> 05:25.367
...that uniform would protect me forever.

05:31.957 --> 05:33.250
[Sunok] So...

05:36.211 --> 05:38.171
...what happened with
that man you mentioned?

05:41.174 --> 05:42.467
It's over now.

05:43.593 --> 05:44.594
Why?

05:47.639 --> 05:50.851
[zipper unzipping]

05:51.518 --> 05:52.978
[Heeju exhales]

05:57.524 --> 05:58.733
It's because of this.

06:01.820 --> 06:03.280
[Sunok] What?

06:03.363 --> 06:04.573
What is that?

06:05.115 --> 06:06.116
[Heeju] Mom.

06:06.616 --> 06:08.785
With something like this,

06:08.869 --> 06:12.581
you can do anything you want to do
and avoid anything you don't want.

06:13.498 --> 06:16.167
That's probably why people will do
whatever they can to get it.

06:16.251 --> 06:17.544
[breathing shakily]

06:19.462 --> 06:20.630
I did, too.

06:23.425 --> 06:26.553
I was afraid to face someone I loved
and was grateful for...

06:27.429 --> 06:29.222
[Heeju] ...because I really thought...

06:30.098 --> 06:31.683
...I thought he'd take it all from me.

06:34.185 --> 06:36.730
So I decided I'm going
to give him back half of it.

06:36.813 --> 06:38.481
It was his in the first place.

06:39.649 --> 06:40.984
[Heeju] I know I'm selfish.

06:41.568 --> 06:43.695
But maybe by doing this
I will finally be able

06:43.778 --> 06:46.740
to find happiness in this life
just like I always wanted.

06:48.158 --> 06:49.326
I have to try.

06:50.076 --> 06:51.411
[Sunok] You...

06:53.496 --> 06:54.706
This is why.

06:54.789 --> 06:56.207
[inhales]

06:57.959 --> 07:00.420
This is why you've been acting so strange.

07:02.422 --> 07:04.341
Even after seeing me...

07:05.967 --> 07:08.970
...you still don't know what happens
when greed takes over?

07:10.722 --> 07:14.976
[Sunok] Heeju, you never used
to be like this.

07:16.061 --> 07:18.480
I know that.
I know I've changed.

07:21.274 --> 07:23.109
Is that really such a bad thing?

07:23.193 --> 07:27.197
[Heeju] If I'm nothing but bad luck
and I was never meant to have this

07:27.280 --> 07:28.990
and I just give it up,

07:29.074 --> 07:31.117
what do you think's going
to happen to me then?

07:32.702 --> 07:38.041
I'll just live Kim Heeju's old life
and die Yeo Sunok's death.

07:39.417 --> 07:41.503
Is that the kind
of future you want for me?

07:43.588 --> 07:45.215
Heeju.

07:46.257 --> 07:47.342
Don't worry, Mom.

07:48.009 --> 07:49.177
I'll be outta here soon.

07:49.761 --> 07:51.680
Just like you wanted, only...

07:52.472 --> 07:54.432
...I want you to come with me, too.

07:54.933 --> 07:56.351
Where are you going to go?

07:58.812 --> 07:59.896
Far away.

08:01.231 --> 08:02.565
Somewhere very far.

08:02.649 --> 08:05.652
[wind rustling tree branches]

08:05.735 --> 08:07.779
[birds chirping]

08:07.862 --> 08:10.490
[Heeju] To a small French village up on
a mountaintop...

08:11.908 --> 08:14.035
...past endless fields of lavender.

08:14.119 --> 08:15.829
[church bell chimes]

08:15.912 --> 08:17.622
[Heeju] It never smells like coal mines.

08:17.706 --> 08:20.208
It only smells like lavender
and clean air.

08:21.209 --> 08:23.545
Everyone there is happy and smiling.

08:24.587 --> 08:27.966
You and I can be like that, too,
if we go.

08:30.552 --> 08:31.636
[Sunok] Do you mean it?

08:34.222 --> 08:35.807
You're gonna take me with you?

08:38.810 --> 08:39.936
Mm-hmm.

08:42.063 --> 08:43.106
[Sunok] Okay.

08:44.899 --> 08:46.276
And if I die...

08:48.236 --> 08:50.989
...you can still go and scatter my ashes.

08:57.495 --> 08:59.039
[sniffles]

09:16.806 --> 09:19.809
[♪ sad piano music]

09:53.551 --> 09:56.554
[♪ music continues]

09:59.349 --> 10:00.975
EPISODE 8
CHOICE
STYLE
::cue()

10:01.059 --> 10:02.977
[Woogy] My father gave this
to me before he passed away.

10:03.061 --> 10:04.062
[Shop Keeper] Oh, really?

10:04.604 --> 10:07.065
Heh, still, who would
have thought the price

10:07.148 --> 10:08.775
of gold would get this high, right?

10:08.858 --> 10:12.237
So these gold bars,
your father left them to you?

10:14.572 --> 10:16.866
Yeah. Well, he only gave me two.

10:16.950 --> 10:21.246
And about two weeks ago you came in to,
uh, sell the other gold bar?

10:21.663 --> 10:24.332
Your name is Kim Mincheol,
isn't it, sir?

10:24.791 --> 10:26.167
That was me, yeah.

10:26.251 --> 10:27.585
Please wait here a sec.

10:31.422 --> 10:32.423
[inhales]

10:32.507 --> 10:33.508
[clicks tongue]

10:36.970 --> 10:37.971
Everything in order?

10:38.054 --> 10:39.055
-Yeah, it looks good.
-Good.

10:40.098 --> 10:42.100
Well, I'll see you again.

10:42.183 --> 10:43.351
-[laughs]
-Yeah.

10:43.977 --> 10:45.270
-Thank you very much.
-Sure.

10:45.353 --> 10:46.729
-Thank you, sir.
-Yeah.

10:49.607 --> 10:50.608
[door opens]

10:58.199 --> 10:59.325
[phone chimes]

10:59.534 --> 11:00.577
[phone trilling]

11:00.660 --> 11:02.370
Hello, President Ko.

11:02.453 --> 11:04.873
I'm calling from Lucky Jewelry
in Daejeong.

11:04.956 --> 11:07.208
[car engine rumbling]

11:07.292 --> 11:10.295
[emergency sirens passing]

11:26.436 --> 11:28.771
[car engine turns over]

11:28.855 --> 11:30.732
[car engine starts]

11:44.495 --> 11:45.705
[tires squeal]

11:51.502 --> 11:54.505
[engine revving]

12:01.971 --> 12:04.724
Where on Earth are you headed now?

12:10.271 --> 12:13.107
[engine revving]

12:13.900 --> 12:16.903
[tires squealing]

12:33.628 --> 12:36.631
[car creaking]

12:40.426 --> 12:42.720
[inhales deeply]

13:01.948 --> 13:04.951
[engine revving]

13:38.026 --> 13:40.570
[engine rumbling]

14:13.853 --> 14:15.563
Ah, shit.

14:18.691 --> 14:21.694
[engine revving]

14:40.713 --> 14:42.757
[breathing heavily]

14:42.840 --> 14:45.009
[tires squealing]
STYLE
::cue()

14:55.353 --> 14:58.356
[cell phone vibrating]

15:02.860 --> 15:03.861
Hello, sir?

15:03.945 --> 15:05.363
[Moonsu] Where the hell are you right now?

15:05.446 --> 15:07.824
Ju Haran's ID card, did you take it?

15:10.451 --> 15:12.203
What? Who?

15:12.954 --> 15:16.374
It's fucking chaos.
Ko has everyone looking for you.

15:16.457 --> 15:18.626
[Moonsu] Get your ass back here
before things get out of hand.

15:19.168 --> 15:21.629
Uh, I'm not sure what
you're talking about.

15:22.755 --> 15:24.757
And also, sir, I quit already.

15:25.883 --> 15:26.884
[Moonsu] Woogy.

15:28.344 --> 15:29.512
I'm warning you.

15:30.388 --> 15:31.722
Uh, sir, but--
[phone disconnects]

15:32.348 --> 15:34.308
Ah, shit.

15:34.684 --> 15:36.394
Fuck, I knew this would happen.

15:36.477 --> 15:38.229
Shit, shit, shit, shit.

15:38.312 --> 15:39.772
[breathing heavily]

15:42.942 --> 15:44.569
[breathing heavily]

15:44.652 --> 15:46.904
I'm fucked.
I'm fucked.

15:46.988 --> 15:48.906
Oh, shit, I'm so fucked.

15:49.740 --> 15:51.033
[Woogy] How'd they know?

15:51.117 --> 15:54.120
[panicked breathing]

15:54.203 --> 15:55.621
Damn, this is crazy.

15:55.705 --> 15:58.291
[heavy breathing]

16:06.215 --> 16:07.383
Okay, okay.

16:07.466 --> 16:09.886
This'll be more than enough. Yeah?

16:11.721 --> 16:13.472
What else can I do?

16:13.556 --> 16:15.266
Gotta save my own ass first.

16:15.349 --> 16:16.809
[panting]

16:20.062 --> 16:21.606
Right.

16:22.064 --> 16:23.316
I don't have a choice.

16:25.276 --> 16:27.820
Heeju, I'm sorry.

16:28.571 --> 16:29.906
I'm sorry.

16:29.989 --> 16:31.824
[car engine turns over]
[Woogy] Fuck, I don't know!

16:39.707 --> 16:42.710
[tires squealing]

16:48.674 --> 16:50.718
[car horn honking]

16:53.763 --> 16:54.764
[horn blares]

16:56.349 --> 16:57.475
Stop the car!

16:59.143 --> 17:00.937
[Jinman] Kim Heeju!

17:01.020 --> 17:02.772
Stop the car and pull over!

17:03.314 --> 17:04.357
[exhales]

17:05.942 --> 17:08.569
[Jinman] Kim Heeju!
Stop! I need to talk to you!

17:09.362 --> 17:10.488
I just need a minute!

17:10.571 --> 17:12.573
Please, just pull over!

17:13.532 --> 17:14.909
[tires squealing]

17:16.077 --> 17:17.078
[gasps]

17:17.662 --> 17:18.996
[tires squealing]

17:19.747 --> 17:20.748
[clanging]

17:23.042 --> 17:25.002
[erratic breathing]

17:32.718 --> 17:34.178
Ah, shit.

17:35.721 --> 17:38.724
[breathing heavily]

17:39.642 --> 17:41.143
[Jinman] Ms. Kim Heeju!

17:41.227 --> 17:42.603
[Jinman yanking door handle]

17:42.687 --> 17:46.440
Please step out of the car, yeah?
Don't you remember me?

17:46.524 --> 17:49.068
I'm a detective, Kim Jinman.
Don't you remember?

17:49.151 --> 17:50.778
I'm trying to help you!
You're in serious danger!

17:50.861 --> 17:51.862
Come on, step out!

17:52.363 --> 17:53.823
[Jinman] I'm not gonna hurt you!

17:56.617 --> 17:57.702
[exhales]

17:59.036 --> 18:02.873
[Jinman] Finally.
Okay, do you have a plan?
STYLE
::cue()

18:02.957 --> 18:04.292
You're in serious trouble.
You know that.

18:04.959 --> 18:05.960
Right?

18:06.961 --> 18:08.254
[Jinman] Where are the gold bars?

18:09.046 --> 18:10.965
Are they in the car? Here?

18:11.048 --> 18:11.924
[car door opens]

18:13.217 --> 18:14.844
[exhales]

18:16.429 --> 18:18.681
[grunts]

18:25.938 --> 18:28.441
[exhales]

18:29.734 --> 18:30.901
[Jinman] The gold bars, where were you--

18:30.985 --> 18:32.236
[Heeju gasps]

18:37.742 --> 18:38.951
Is that a real gun?

18:39.035 --> 18:41.120
[Jinman] Is it?
Have you ever even fired it?

18:41.746 --> 18:42.913
Come on. Give it here.

18:42.997 --> 18:44.665
[gun cocks]

18:45.374 --> 18:46.792
[Heeju] Close the trunk right now.

18:48.085 --> 18:49.337
The trunk! Close it!

18:51.213 --> 18:54.216
[exhales]

18:59.722 --> 19:00.723
[Jinman] Kim Heeju.

19:00.806 --> 19:03.851
Listen, do you realize how serious
this situation is?

19:03.934 --> 19:07.063
Do you have any idea who you're dealing
with right now? Huh?

19:07.855 --> 19:09.774
[Jinman] The situation
is incredibly dangerous.

19:10.399 --> 19:12.401
The Geumseong guys.
Yes Money.

19:12.943 --> 19:14.862
It's only a matter
of time before they track you down.

19:14.945 --> 19:16.238
And once they do, they'll kill you!

19:16.322 --> 19:17.865
-[Jinman] Do you get that?
-Of course I do.

19:18.491 --> 19:22.036
Do you? Really?
Why do this, huh?

19:22.620 --> 19:24.789
[Jinman] Those gold bars
don't belong to you!

19:24.872 --> 19:26.374
They belong to Chairman Ahn!

19:26.832 --> 19:28.876
You can live if you return the gold!

19:29.460 --> 19:30.961
[Jinman] If you're too scared
to give it back,

19:31.045 --> 19:32.171
I'll do it for you.

19:32.588 --> 19:34.048
Then you can leave the country!

19:34.131 --> 19:36.467
I'll help you get a passport
and anything else you need!

19:36.550 --> 19:37.843
[Heeju] Don't lie to me.

19:37.927 --> 19:40.721
What did Chairman Ahn promise you
for handing me over?

19:40.805 --> 19:43.140
Ah, you don't understand
a word I'm saying.

19:43.224 --> 19:44.392
[Heeju] Go!

19:45.017 --> 19:46.602
Just get outta here, please!

19:46.686 --> 19:48.312
If I was going to,

19:48.396 --> 19:50.773
I would have given the gold back
a long time ago!

19:51.273 --> 19:52.900
[Jinman] The gold bars
have completely blinded you

19:52.983 --> 19:54.110
and now you're not thinking straight!

19:54.193 --> 19:55.903
[Jinman] You've completely lost your mind!

19:56.487 --> 19:57.697
Just take a breath, okay?

19:57.780 --> 19:59.573
Let's try and be realistic here.

20:00.950 --> 20:03.160
You can't turn all the bars into cash.

20:03.244 --> 20:04.495
[Jinman] And even if you do,

20:04.578 --> 20:06.956
you realize that's over
100 billion won, right?

20:07.039 --> 20:09.166
How are you gonna spend all
that money before you die?

20:09.250 --> 20:10.418
Huh?

20:10.918 --> 20:12.712
[Jinman] If I return the gold
to Chairman Ahn,

20:12.795 --> 20:14.004
he promised to pay me!

20:14.547 --> 20:16.215
And I'll give all of it to you.

20:17.466 --> 20:19.009
[Jinman] Then you get to live!

20:19.802 --> 20:21.554
You can go somewhere far away!

20:23.723 --> 20:24.807
Like France, huh?

20:24.890 --> 20:26.684
[Jinman] Take your mom
and go to France!

20:27.393 --> 20:29.270
Sound like a plan? Yeah?

20:29.353 --> 20:30.938
[Jinman] Give me the gun.

20:31.021 --> 20:31.897
[gunshot]

20:34.024 --> 20:35.109
Don't you dare move!

20:38.696 --> 20:40.197
Don't follow me.

20:40.614 --> 20:42.199
[Heeju] Don't go looking for me.

20:42.283 --> 20:43.743
And you'd better leave my aunt alone, too!

20:44.285 --> 20:45.494
[car door opens]

20:46.662 --> 20:47.955
[car engine turns over]

20:48.038 --> 20:49.206
Hey, Kim Heeju!

20:51.083 --> 20:52.334
[clangs]

20:55.004 --> 20:56.589
[distant tires squealing]

20:59.425 --> 21:02.428
[car engine revving]
STYLE
::cue()

21:06.974 --> 21:08.267
[exhales]

21:12.021 --> 21:14.565
[cell phone vibrates]

21:14.648 --> 21:17.401
HEEJU

21:17.485 --> 21:19.028
Ah, dammit, seriously?

21:30.706 --> 21:33.709
[cell phone vibrates]

21:37.797 --> 21:39.298
HEEJU

21:39.799 --> 21:41.383
[clears throat]

21:41.467 --> 21:42.635
Hey, Heeju.

21:43.010 --> 21:45.012
[Heeju] Detective Kim tailed me.

21:45.095 --> 21:46.889
He just pulled me over.

21:46.972 --> 21:49.517
And he saw the gold bars in my trunk, too.

21:49.600 --> 21:50.601
[Woogy] What?

21:50.684 --> 21:52.144
How did he know to follow you?

21:52.728 --> 21:54.605
[Heeju] I think he was staking out
the hospital.

21:54.688 --> 21:56.524
He had to be listening in.

21:57.650 --> 22:00.236
Somehow he knew everything I said
to my aunt there.

22:00.319 --> 22:01.779
[Woogy] Wait. So then...

22:02.947 --> 22:06.575
...he has to know you're really Kim Heeju
and not Ju Haran.

22:08.077 --> 22:10.079
[Woogy] What about now?
Is he still tailing you?

22:10.162 --> 22:11.831
Uh, no. I'm okay.

22:12.414 --> 22:14.416
I threatened him with the gun and ran.

22:15.584 --> 22:17.002
Okay, good work.

22:17.086 --> 22:19.630
So anyway, now you better just
find somewhere to hide.

22:19.713 --> 22:20.714
And then...

22:21.590 --> 22:23.384
...well, I'll figure out what's going on
and call you.

22:23.467 --> 22:24.468
[Heeju] No.

22:24.969 --> 22:27.847
I don't have time for that.
Where are you now?

22:27.930 --> 22:29.890
[Heeju] Are you still at
the jewelry store?

22:30.516 --> 22:31.851
Did you get the cash yet?

22:31.934 --> 22:34.103
Uh, yeah.

22:35.020 --> 22:36.230
The jewelry store.

22:36.814 --> 22:38.148
I got the cash already.

22:39.108 --> 22:40.693
I'm gonna head that way now.

22:41.569 --> 22:42.778
I'll meet you there.

22:42.862 --> 22:44.113
[cell phone disconnects]

22:52.079 --> 22:53.455
Ah!

22:56.292 --> 22:57.585
[exhales]

22:57.668 --> 22:58.878
Dammit.

23:00.087 --> 23:01.714
[exhales]

23:01.797 --> 23:03.757
[Woogy] Okay, let's just run.

23:04.717 --> 23:05.968
All right.

23:06.051 --> 23:07.887
Fuck it. Whatever.

23:09.221 --> 23:10.764
Yeah, fuck it.
I don't care.

23:12.641 --> 23:13.976
Ah, fuck.

23:14.059 --> 23:17.062
[tires squealing]
[car horns honking]

23:23.944 --> 23:25.029
[cell phone trilling]

23:25.112 --> 23:27.031
Hey, I'm almost there now.
What about you?

23:28.741 --> 23:29.992
[Heeju] Are you there yet?

23:30.075 --> 23:31.368
Yeah, I'm here already.

23:31.452 --> 23:33.370
[Heeju] You are?
I don't see you.

23:34.246 --> 23:35.956
[Woogy] Do you see me waving
at the end of the alley?

23:38.751 --> 23:41.921
Oh. Yeah, I see you.
STYLE
::cue()

23:42.588 --> 23:43.589
Is that your car?

23:44.298 --> 23:45.925
Here, over here.
You can park--

23:50.554 --> 23:51.931
Uh, hey, Heeju.

23:52.014 --> 23:53.849
I think the guys are here.
Open the window. The window.

23:53.933 --> 23:55.225
Hurry. Open it. The window.

23:56.644 --> 23:58.354
Hey, isn't that Woogy?

23:59.813 --> 24:01.231
The window. Just open it.

24:01.690 --> 24:02.691
The window?

24:07.196 --> 24:08.322
-[Moonsu] Get him!
-[Woogy] Heeju!

24:08.405 --> 24:11.033
In my car! I got the gold bars
and the cash.

24:11.116 --> 24:12.451
[Woogy] Go get 'em!

24:12.534 --> 24:13.869
And then go hide somewhere! Hurry!

24:13.953 --> 24:15.079
-[Heeju] Hello?
-[Moonsu] Hey!

24:15.162 --> 24:16.830
[Woogy] Shit!
[breathing heavily]

24:16.914 --> 24:18.040
[Moonsu] Woogy!

24:19.041 --> 24:21.001
Woogy? You there?

24:25.965 --> 24:26.966
[Moonsu] Ah!

24:27.049 --> 24:29.385
[crowd shouting]

24:29.468 --> 24:31.971
[Moonsu] Son of a bitch!
Woogy!

24:33.597 --> 24:36.600
[Woogy breathing heavily]

24:37.601 --> 24:40.187
[Moonsu] Hey! Stop!

24:42.272 --> 24:44.108
-[Moonsu] Guys, split up!
-This way.

24:44.191 --> 24:45.234
[Henchman B] Come on!

24:46.026 --> 24:48.237
[Moonsu] Hey! You motherfucker!

24:48.320 --> 24:50.948
[Woogy breathing erratically]

24:52.783 --> 24:54.159
[all groaning]

24:54.827 --> 24:57.454
[Moonsu] What the fuck?
Go, go, go, go, go, go!

25:01.041 --> 25:02.042
[Moonsu] Get him!

25:02.126 --> 25:03.794
[Woogy breathing heavily]

25:06.880 --> 25:09.091
[Woogy groaning]

25:09.174 --> 25:10.175
Come on, man.
We're like brothers.

25:10.259 --> 25:12.386
-Let's go, Woogy.
-[Woogy] Can't we talk it out?

25:12.469 --> 25:14.722
Stay back!
I said stay back, for fuck's sake!

25:16.390 --> 25:17.641
[Woogy] Don't come any closer.

25:17.725 --> 25:19.560
Ah, fuck this shit!

25:19.643 --> 25:20.728
[grunts]

25:20.811 --> 25:22.229
Shit, shit!

25:22.312 --> 25:23.605
[shouts]

25:24.732 --> 25:26.442
Shit, shit.

25:26.525 --> 25:28.152
-[groaning]
-[Moonsu] Ah, fuck!

25:28.235 --> 25:29.570
He went that way!
Come on, let's go!

25:30.863 --> 25:32.781
[breathing heavily]

25:32.865 --> 25:34.158
Oh, shit.

25:41.540 --> 25:44.001
Ah, fuck's sake.

25:44.084 --> 25:46.295
[labored breathing]

25:46.378 --> 25:47.755
Ah, shit.

25:50.549 --> 25:52.051
[door creaks]

25:52.593 --> 25:53.635
[grunts]

25:53.719 --> 25:55.345
[door locking]

25:55.721 --> 25:57.931
[groaning]

26:05.147 --> 26:06.774
[banging on door]

26:06.857 --> 26:08.275
[Moonsu] Woogy, open up!

26:09.777 --> 26:10.944
[Moonsu] I'm gonna break it down!

26:11.570 --> 26:12.654
You hear me?

26:12.738 --> 26:13.864
[groans]

26:13.947 --> 26:15.157
[banging on door]

26:15.240 --> 26:17.117
[Moonsu] Woogy!
STYLE
::cue()

26:24.416 --> 26:27.628
[cell phone vibrates]

26:27.711 --> 26:28.837
Woogy, hey.

26:29.213 --> 26:31.131
[Woogy breathing heavily]
[Woogy] Heeju.

26:31.799 --> 26:33.300
[panting]

26:33.383 --> 26:35.427
What are you gonna do with that money?

26:35.511 --> 26:37.429
What are you talking about?

26:37.513 --> 26:39.014
Tell me where you are, please.

26:40.099 --> 26:42.101
I've seen it happen over and over.

26:42.768 --> 26:43.894
[Moonsu] Hey, Woogy!

26:44.478 --> 26:47.356
Stupid people who got greedy
and ruined their lives.

26:47.856 --> 26:49.608
My father was one of those guys.

26:49.691 --> 26:52.694
[Moonsu] Open the door while
I'm asking nicely. 'Kay?

26:53.237 --> 26:55.489
And fuck me.
I guess I got greedy, too.

26:57.533 --> 26:59.618
[Woogy] I didn't even get
to spend all the money.

27:00.577 --> 27:02.246
Just tell me where you are right now.

27:02.913 --> 27:04.456
Did you get away from those guys?

27:05.541 --> 27:07.126
[Moonsu] Hey, motherfucker!

27:07.209 --> 27:08.794
Just open the door!

27:08.877 --> 27:10.212
-Heeju.
-[Moonsu] Huh?

27:11.713 --> 27:12.840
Open up!

27:14.591 --> 27:16.260
I won't last long at the farm, okay?

27:16.343 --> 27:18.428
-[Moonsu] You son of a bitch!
-I'll give up your name.

27:19.888 --> 27:24.184
[Woogy] So as soon as we hang up,
you need to run as far as you can.

27:25.060 --> 27:26.353
You can take all the gold.

27:26.645 --> 27:28.272
-[Moonsu] Break the door down.
-You'll find it in the trunk

27:28.355 --> 27:29.815
with the cash.
All of it is there.

27:29.898 --> 27:30.983
[Moonsu] Harder, you idiot!

27:31.066 --> 27:33.151
Take everything.
Take it and run.

27:33.235 --> 27:35.153
-[Woogy] Got it?
-Hey, you just--

27:35.237 --> 27:38.073
just make it as long as you can.
I'll--I'll be there right away.

27:38.657 --> 27:40.284
[Woogy] You know
what this reminds me of?

27:41.702 --> 27:43.245
When we used to play freeze tag.

27:44.079 --> 27:45.914
[bangs on door]
[Moonsu groans]

27:45.998 --> 27:48.083
I got tagged in the mining town
and had to freeze.

27:48.166 --> 27:49.293
[Moonsu] What are you doing?

27:49.793 --> 27:51.169
[Moonsu] Try lifting it.

27:51.628 --> 27:53.672
I was so scared until you tagged me.

27:53.755 --> 27:54.798
[Moonsu] Break the whole thing down!

27:54.882 --> 27:56.216
[door bangs]

27:56.300 --> 27:57.676
You really forgot all that?

27:57.759 --> 27:58.886
[door clanging]

27:59.511 --> 28:00.637
[exhales]

28:00.721 --> 28:01.889
-Woogy--
-[Woogy] I gotta go.

28:01.972 --> 28:03.765
-[Moonsu] Open it, fucker!
-Wait a minute.

28:03.849 --> 28:05.183
-Woogy? Hey!
-[Moonsu] The fuck are you doing?

28:05.726 --> 28:07.185
[breathing heavily]
[phone disconnects]

28:07.269 --> 28:10.272
[grunting]
[clanging]

28:11.356 --> 28:14.359
[all breathing heavily]

28:20.282 --> 28:21.283
[Moonsu] Woogy.

28:21.950 --> 28:22.993
Let's go.

28:25.954 --> 28:27.873
[exhales]

28:27.956 --> 28:29.499
Oh, what do I do?

28:31.460 --> 28:33.962
[car engine turns over]

28:36.715 --> 28:38.258
[exhales]

28:45.223 --> 28:46.224
The gold bars are in the trunk.

28:47.559 --> 28:48.602
[Dokyung] Heeju.

28:50.312 --> 28:53.023
I'll sell the gold bars
and I'll come right back.
STYLE
::cue()

28:53.774 --> 28:54.775
[grunts]

28:55.359 --> 28:56.401
Don't bother.

28:57.110 --> 28:59.279
This will be the last time
we see each other.

29:00.113 --> 29:01.865
[Dokyung] You still have
Ju Haran's account, right?

29:02.616 --> 29:04.242
Once I get the cash for the gold,

29:04.326 --> 29:06.244
I'll wire the money back
to the bank account.

29:07.496 --> 29:09.039
What? Why?

29:09.122 --> 29:10.749
[Dokyung] Because you don't trust me
right now.

29:12.501 --> 29:13.502
So...

29:14.419 --> 29:16.755
I wanna make sure you get your half first.

29:18.548 --> 29:21.009
You wanna break up because you're afraid
I'll take everything.

29:22.094 --> 29:23.095
But...

29:24.805 --> 29:27.391
...now that I have my share,
I know what matters.

29:28.433 --> 29:29.810
I can lose everything else.

29:30.644 --> 29:31.937
But I can't lose you, Heeju.

29:32.604 --> 29:34.106
[exhales]

29:34.189 --> 29:35.315
Come on.

29:37.192 --> 29:39.444
Ah, what's happening here, huh?

29:40.904 --> 29:42.739
[Donggu] Is this the guy getting on
the ferry?

29:43.782 --> 29:44.783
Yeah.

29:45.784 --> 29:46.785
Oh.

29:47.703 --> 29:49.705
Pay up. Money.

29:49.788 --> 29:50.914
-[Donggu] Come on. Money, money.
-Uh...

29:54.835 --> 29:55.836
You can check it.

29:58.255 --> 29:59.256
[zipper unzips]

30:02.968 --> 30:03.969
[exhales]

30:04.553 --> 30:05.762
Let's go.

30:05.846 --> 30:07.097
[car door closes]

30:07.180 --> 30:09.057
[car engine turns over]

30:11.101 --> 30:12.269
[car door closes]

30:16.815 --> 30:17.941
[gears shifting]

30:20.652 --> 30:23.488
[engine rumbling]

30:25.782 --> 30:28.410
[engine revving]

30:39.254 --> 30:40.672
[car alarm beeps]

30:43.258 --> 30:45.761
[grunting]

30:47.763 --> 30:49.723
[breathing heavily]

30:51.433 --> 30:52.434
[phone beeps]

30:52.517 --> 30:55.520
[trilling]

30:57.355 --> 30:58.815
[exhales]

31:01.568 --> 31:04.571
[cell phone vibrating]

31:06.281 --> 31:12.913
HEEJU

31:12.996 --> 31:15.582
[phone trilling]

31:15.665 --> 31:18.585
Come on. Please pick up the phone.

31:20.253 --> 31:21.797
[exhales]
STYLE
::cue()

31:24.341 --> 31:27.594
[dog barking]

31:31.973 --> 31:33.391
[pigs oinking]

31:33.475 --> 31:34.851
[Gitae] Boss, over here.

31:35.644 --> 31:36.853
[Hocheol] Where is he?

31:36.937 --> 31:38.396
He's that way. I'll show you.

31:39.147 --> 31:40.982
[Gitae] Hey bro! Hey!

31:41.066 --> 31:42.484
Let's go get this over with.

31:42.567 --> 31:43.652
Come on.

31:43.735 --> 31:45.570
[exhales]
Let's get outta here.

31:45.654 --> 31:47.030
It fuckin' reeks.

31:52.619 --> 31:55.622
[door creaks]

32:04.464 --> 32:08.260
[erratic breathing]

32:09.094 --> 32:10.887
[Hocheol] Where's the gold?

32:13.306 --> 32:14.850
I--I don't know.

32:14.933 --> 32:17.269
[inhales on cigarette]

32:19.479 --> 32:21.481
I mean it. If I knew,
I woulda told the company.

32:22.941 --> 32:23.942
[Woogy] But that bitch...

32:26.194 --> 32:27.904
...she wouldn't tell me where
she hid the gold.

32:31.741 --> 32:33.410
I'm so sorry, Boss.

32:35.036 --> 32:36.496
I was blinded by the gold.

32:38.582 --> 32:40.417
She gave me these one-kilo bars.

32:40.500 --> 32:42.002
She asked me to sell them for her.

32:43.795 --> 32:45.589
Said I could keep one out of ten.

32:47.883 --> 32:48.967
Who is she?

32:51.178 --> 32:52.554
I don't know her name, sir.

32:52.637 --> 32:54.472
Do you think I'm fucking stupid?

32:56.892 --> 32:57.893
[clattering]

32:59.436 --> 33:01.730
I really don't know.
I really don't. Please, I don't know.

33:01.813 --> 33:03.356
[Woogy] Boss, please, please!
Please, Boss! I don't--

33:03.440 --> 33:05.358
[screams]

33:05.442 --> 33:07.819
You were the one who took Ju Haran's ID
and passed it onto that bitch.

33:08.486 --> 33:10.071
I--I mean it, boss!
I really don't know her name! Please!

33:10.155 --> 33:11.865
Please, you gotta believe me!
I don't know anything! Please!

33:11.948 --> 33:14.159
[screaming]

33:14.868 --> 33:18.038
She just told me to call her Boss.

33:18.121 --> 33:19.539
[whimpering]

33:19.623 --> 33:21.166
[tool clanging]

33:21.249 --> 33:22.709
[Woogy whimpers]

33:22.792 --> 33:25.795
[breathing erratically]

33:27.214 --> 33:28.298
[Hocheol] Fine, then.

33:31.384 --> 33:32.969
Choose from these pictures.

33:34.846 --> 33:36.431
[Woogy] No.

33:40.477 --> 33:43.104
N--no.

33:47.984 --> 33:49.152
No.

33:49.236 --> 33:50.862
[whimpers and swallows]

33:51.363 --> 33:52.697
It's not Kim Heeju?

33:53.949 --> 33:55.116
No.

33:59.579 --> 34:01.623
You told me you didn't know her name.

34:02.457 --> 34:03.959
[Hocheol] How do you know it's not her?

34:06.044 --> 34:07.545
I...

34:07.629 --> 34:09.589
[breathing heavily]

34:09.673 --> 34:11.633
-[Woogy groans]
-Fucker.

34:12.217 --> 34:13.343
No, sir, I real--
I really don't know!

34:13.426 --> 34:14.427
[blow lands]
[screaming]

34:14.511 --> 34:16.471
[wailing and crying]

34:16.554 --> 34:17.639
[blow lands]

34:17.722 --> 34:20.725
[Woogy sobbing]

34:21.768 --> 34:22.894
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

34:22.978 --> 34:25.397
[screaming]
STYLE
::cue()

34:26.815 --> 34:28.066
Hey, Director Park.

34:28.149 --> 34:29.442
I looked into Kim Heeju.

34:29.859 --> 34:31.361
I texted you her background check.

34:31.945 --> 34:33.196
And I pulled her phone records.

34:33.697 --> 34:35.407
[Kang] Looks like her phone
is currently off.

34:36.116 --> 34:38.576
There's no call activity
for the past few days, either.

34:39.494 --> 34:41.413
And then about a week ago,

34:41.496 --> 34:44.833
some of her phone's location pings
started matching Ju Haran's.

34:45.500 --> 34:46.501
Which ones?

34:47.502 --> 34:50.714
[Kang] Gangwon Saebyeok Hospital
and Ilyeong Industrial Complex.

34:51.381 --> 34:52.674
Where's Ilyeong?

34:52.757 --> 34:56.219
[Kang] Uh, yeah, you know, the area
along Route 6 with the warehouses.

34:56.303 --> 34:59.389
-The redevelopment area.
-Huh.

34:59.472 --> 35:03.727
And also on Bukju street in Jeongsan.
The Haengbok Pawnshop, too.

35:05.103 --> 35:06.813
Can you check out the industrial complex?

35:06.896 --> 35:08.231
[Kang] Uh, yeah.

35:08.315 --> 35:09.316
I can do that.

35:10.025 --> 35:11.192
[phone disconnects]

35:11.276 --> 35:12.360
Gitae!

35:13.111 --> 35:14.112
[Gitae] Yes, Boss!

35:15.238 --> 35:18.116
Send some of your guys over
to Haengbok Pawnshop on Bukju Street.

35:18.700 --> 35:19.784
[Hocheol] I'll send you the pictures.

35:20.368 --> 35:21.828
[Gitae] Haengbok Pawnshop, sir?

35:22.287 --> 35:24.497
Actually, you should go yourself.

35:24.581 --> 35:25.582
Yes, sir.

35:28.209 --> 35:29.210
[door creaks]

35:29.294 --> 35:30.295
[phone chimes]

35:30.378 --> 35:31.504
[phone trilling]

35:32.380 --> 35:34.674
[Hocheol] Hey, Mister Jin.
Can you take care of some meat?

35:34.758 --> 35:36.968
I'm in the barn.
The operating room.

35:39.554 --> 35:40.972
[Hocheol] No, he's still alive.

35:44.017 --> 35:45.602
Yeah, cutting up and butchering.

35:45.685 --> 35:47.187
[uneasy breathing]

35:47.270 --> 35:49.189
[Hocheol] You can do whatever you want
with the organs.

35:49.272 --> 35:50.940
Please don't kill me.

35:51.608 --> 35:52.734
[groans]

35:54.444 --> 35:56.196
[Gitae] Here, here, here, here, here.
I think that's the one.

35:56.655 --> 35:57.822
-Yeah, that looks like it.
-Stop here.

35:57.906 --> 36:00.742
-Haengbok.
-Yeah. Okay.

36:03.620 --> 36:06.623
[♪ tense music]

36:12.212 --> 36:15.632
HAENGBOK PAWNSHOP

36:19.928 --> 36:23.181
[engine rumbling]

36:26.393 --> 36:29.396
[crickets chirping]

36:33.066 --> 36:35.193
[doors clanging]

36:36.528 --> 36:37.529
[chain rattles]

36:38.321 --> 36:39.531
[lock clicks]

36:39.614 --> 36:42.617
[door scraping]

36:43.827 --> 36:45.495
[groans]

36:47.455 --> 36:49.916
[Manager] We just rent out the space here.
That's all.

36:50.750 --> 36:52.752
We don't check what they're using it for.

36:54.879 --> 36:56.131
[Manager exhales]

36:58.800 --> 37:00.009
[Kang exhales]

37:09.519 --> 37:10.812
[Manager] They do something bad?

37:10.895 --> 37:12.105
[Kang] No, nothin' big.

37:12.188 --> 37:13.231
Just a petty crime.

37:14.023 --> 37:15.233
If they come back here...

37:16.401 --> 37:17.485
...be sure to call me right away.

37:17.569 --> 37:18.653
GANGWON CENTRAL POLICE AGENCY
INVESTIGATIONS DIVISION

37:18.737 --> 37:19.821
DETECTIVE KANG DONGHOON

37:20.780 --> 37:21.781
Uh-huh.

37:24.826 --> 37:28.037
[car engine revving]

37:33.668 --> 37:34.878
[GPS chimes]

37:34.961 --> 37:37.005
[GPS] In 100 meters, turn left.

37:38.465 --> 37:39.758
[exhales]

37:42.802 --> 37:44.304
[box rattling]

37:52.395 --> 37:53.772
[Woogy breathing softly]

37:55.315 --> 37:57.025
[rattling]

37:57.984 --> 37:59.402
[muffled grunting]

37:59.486 --> 38:02.489
[panicked breathing]

38:07.452 --> 38:10.455
[muffled shouting]

38:16.044 --> 38:17.545
[muffled groans]

38:22.926 --> 38:26.304
[muffled wailing]
STYLE
::cue()

38:28.056 --> 38:29.682
[Mr. Jin] Don't fight it.

38:30.183 --> 38:32.602
Just let yourself pass out.

38:33.561 --> 38:36.314
If you don't,
it'll be a lot worse.

38:37.273 --> 38:40.276
[muffled shouting continues]

38:41.736 --> 38:44.739
[erratic breathing]

38:56.584 --> 39:00.255
[loud clicking]

39:00.338 --> 39:03.341
CLOSING MINES WITHOUT A PLAN
MEANS NO LIVELIHOOD FOR RESIDENTS!

39:03.424 --> 39:06.427
[children laughing]

39:09.013 --> 39:11.099
-[Young Woogy] Wait up!
-[Boy] Freeze!

39:11.182 --> 39:12.183
Ah!

39:12.267 --> 39:13.434
[children breathing heavily]

39:13.977 --> 39:15.520
[Girl B] Ah! Freeze!

39:16.354 --> 39:17.605
[Girl A] Tag!

39:17.689 --> 39:18.898
[Child] Gonna get you!

39:18.982 --> 39:20.233
[all laughing]

39:20.316 --> 39:22.110
-[girl screams]
-[Child] Freeze!

39:22.193 --> 39:25.196
[laughing continues]

39:25.822 --> 39:27.115
[Child] Come here!

39:27.198 --> 39:28.783
[laughter]

39:28.867 --> 39:30.785
[Child] Stop it!
Get away from me!

39:31.578 --> 39:34.080
[Mother A] Hyewon. That's enough.

39:34.163 --> 39:36.916
Dinner's ready.
Your food's getting cold.

39:37.000 --> 39:40.003
[Mother B] Minu, let's go home!
Come on. It's time for dinner.

39:41.337 --> 39:44.173
[Mother C] I can't believe this.
You little rascal.

39:44.257 --> 39:46.885
Where have you been?
I was worried sick!

39:46.968 --> 39:48.678
[light buzzing]

39:48.761 --> 39:50.179
[Young Heeju] Mongsil!

39:50.263 --> 39:52.432
[breathing heavily]

39:58.271 --> 40:02.066
[crickets chirping]

40:04.235 --> 40:05.612
Why are you here by yourself?

40:06.154 --> 40:07.655
'Cause I'm frozen here.

40:08.072 --> 40:09.407
Everybody else went home.

40:09.490 --> 40:10.700
You better go, too.

40:11.159 --> 40:13.036
I can't until I get tagged.

40:13.578 --> 40:15.038
You're a dummy.

40:15.121 --> 40:16.789
That means you'll be here all night.

40:16.873 --> 40:18.082
There are ghosts here.

40:20.710 --> 40:21.920
Tag me free.

40:23.046 --> 40:24.047
You do it!

40:24.839 --> 40:26.257
[Young Woogy] You tag me!

40:27.300 --> 40:29.010
[engine revving]

40:29.093 --> 40:31.095
[tires squealing]

40:31.179 --> 40:33.473
[crashing]

40:36.893 --> 40:39.395
[creaking]

40:40.480 --> 40:43.483
[Heeju groaning]

40:58.247 --> 40:59.290
Woogy!

40:59.916 --> 41:01.459
[Woogy groaning]

41:03.753 --> 41:06.756
[strained breathing]

41:08.758 --> 41:10.009
Woogy?

41:10.301 --> 41:11.344
Heeju?

41:13.304 --> 41:14.555
Heeju.

41:15.139 --> 41:18.142
[chains rattle]

41:22.605 --> 41:23.773
[Heeju] Is this it?

41:24.190 --> 41:26.693
Okay. Okay. Okay.

41:26.776 --> 41:28.027
[Woogy] You find the key?

41:28.111 --> 41:30.113
-[Heeju] Oh! It worked! Yes.
-You got it? You got it?

41:31.739 --> 41:32.991
What--how do I...

41:33.658 --> 41:35.535
[Woogy] Hey. There.

41:35.618 --> 41:36.786
Shoot.

41:37.412 --> 41:38.746
-[Heeju whimpers]
-[Woogy] There.

41:38.830 --> 41:40.164
[Heeju shouts]
[gun fires]

41:41.082 --> 41:42.750
-[whimpering]
-There, there, there. Shoot. Shoot.

41:42.834 --> 41:45.294
Kill him. There. There.

41:45.378 --> 41:46.546
[whimpering]

41:48.881 --> 41:50.091
[gunshot]

41:52.885 --> 41:55.179
[panicked breathing]

42:01.561 --> 42:04.564
[tires squealing]

42:16.993 --> 42:19.996
[♪ tense music]
STYLE
::cue()

42:26.252 --> 42:27.545
[keyboard clacking]

42:27.628 --> 42:29.338
PATIENT NAME: KIM HEEJU
NO PATIENTS MATCH THE SEARCH CRITERIA.

42:32.550 --> 42:35.553
We don't have anyone named Kim Heeju here.

42:36.054 --> 42:37.305
Ju Haran, then.

42:38.181 --> 42:39.724
Ju Haran.

42:39.807 --> 42:41.934
[keyboard clacking]

42:42.560 --> 42:43.811
I'm sorry.

42:45.813 --> 42:47.315
A guardian, maybe?

42:47.398 --> 42:48.816
What about a guardian?

42:49.609 --> 42:51.235
Kim Heeju or Ju Haran.

42:52.111 --> 42:55.031
[engine rumbling]

42:55.114 --> 42:58.034
[engine groaning]

42:58.117 --> 43:01.120
[crickets chirping]

43:02.747 --> 43:05.750
[rattling]

43:08.836 --> 43:09.837
[engine hissing]

43:10.671 --> 43:12.465
[Heeju] What?

43:12.548 --> 43:13.925
What now?

43:17.011 --> 43:20.014
[breathing heavily]

43:21.265 --> 43:22.433
[Heeju] What?

43:22.517 --> 43:24.018
[exhales]

43:26.771 --> 43:28.106
Ah, shit.

43:30.358 --> 43:33.361
[mask hissing]

44:01.681 --> 44:04.684
[♪ suspenseful music]

44:09.397 --> 44:13.359
CALLS

44:16.070 --> 44:18.197
HEEJU

44:19.073 --> 44:22.118
[Operator] Your call has been forwarded
to an automated voice messaging system.

44:22.201 --> 44:24.036
The number you have dial--
[phone disconnects]

44:33.421 --> 44:35.047
KIM HEEJU

44:35.131 --> 44:36.757
[crickets chirping]

44:36.841 --> 44:39.218
-[Heeju inhales and exhales]
-[Woogy] Where are we?

44:39.886 --> 44:42.138
Huh? Not the pawnshop, right?

44:42.638 --> 44:43.639
We can't go there.

44:44.223 --> 44:45.349
I know.

44:46.976 --> 44:49.061
I was on the way to the workshop.

44:49.395 --> 44:50.688
But then the car broke down.

44:51.981 --> 44:53.232
[Heeju exhales]

44:57.320 --> 44:58.321
Heeju.

45:01.574 --> 45:02.783
We're fucked.

45:04.243 --> 45:05.578
Park knows about you.

45:06.787 --> 45:07.872
He knows you're Ju Haran.

45:09.415 --> 45:11.459
[Woogy] I even held out till the very end.

45:12.043 --> 45:13.085
Fuck.

45:13.753 --> 45:16.756
[cell phone vibrating]

45:19.717 --> 45:21.469
INCOMING CALL
AUNTIE SUNOK

45:24.805 --> 45:26.015
What? Something wrong?

45:27.600 --> 45:30.269
Aunt Sunok has never called me
on this number.

45:30.937 --> 45:33.105
[vibrating continues]

45:33.189 --> 45:35.983
INCOMING CALL
AUNTIE SUNOK

45:40.279 --> 45:43.866
[Hocheol] Am I speaking
with Ms. Yeo Sunok's guardian?

45:44.533 --> 45:45.534
Who are you?

45:47.620 --> 45:49.163
I'm Yeo Sunok's doctor.

45:49.413 --> 45:50.957
I'm in charge of her care.

45:51.874 --> 45:53.251
[Hocheol] Your mother
is in critical condition.

45:53.334 --> 45:54.877
You need to come
to the hospital right away.

45:55.920 --> 45:58.798
I'm using this phone since we didn't
have your number, Ms. Kim Heeju.

46:00.299 --> 46:02.551
[Hocheol] Oh, my mistake.

46:02.635 --> 46:03.928
Ju Haran.

46:05.429 --> 46:06.472
[phone disconnects]

46:06.555 --> 46:07.682
[exhales]

46:11.185 --> 46:14.188
[car engine revving]

46:15.982 --> 46:17.149
[exhales]

46:17.525 --> 46:19.360
My aunt.
Someone's in her hospital room.

46:19.694 --> 46:20.695
Huh?

46:21.612 --> 46:22.905
[gasps]
[phone chimes]

46:22.989 --> 46:25.783
[phone trilling]

46:25.866 --> 46:27.535
[Nurse B] Saebaek Hospital, oncology ward.

46:27.952 --> 46:29.787
Hi, this is Ms. Yeo Sunok's guardian.

46:29.870 --> 46:31.998
Can--can you send someone
to check on her, please?

46:32.081 --> 46:35.960
It seems someone's--there's--there's
someone strange in her room right now.

46:36.043 --> 46:39.380
[distant sirens blaring]

46:45.469 --> 46:47.013
[tires squeal]

46:49.765 --> 46:53.644
[tires squeak]

47:02.611 --> 47:05.614
[engine rumbling]
STYLE
::cue()

47:27.928 --> 47:30.931
[♪ suspenseful music]

47:46.989 --> 47:49.241
[rumbling]

47:54.538 --> 47:55.539
[brakes squeak]

48:12.640 --> 48:14.642
[brakes squeal]

48:21.273 --> 48:22.274
[headlights click]

48:23.025 --> 48:24.026
[sniffs]

48:41.293 --> 48:42.711
[brakes squeak]

48:44.380 --> 48:45.381
[car engine shuts off]

48:48.884 --> 48:50.344
[phone chimes and trills]

48:50.428 --> 48:53.431
[cell phone vibrating]

48:56.350 --> 48:57.351
Hello?

48:58.102 --> 48:59.520
Where are you, Detective Kim?

49:02.606 --> 49:04.358
[Jinman] Uh, I'm at the office right now.

49:04.733 --> 49:06.777
It's a busy night
so I'm doing some overtime.

49:08.863 --> 49:09.864
[Hocheol] Really?

49:10.614 --> 49:14.326
So that gray SUV I see,
that's not your car?

49:14.952 --> 49:17.079
Why'd you ask me
if you knew where I was?

49:22.209 --> 49:23.669
How long have you been following me?

49:24.211 --> 49:25.504
Since the hospital.

49:26.046 --> 49:27.047
Mm.

49:27.131 --> 49:28.883
[lighter clicking]

49:29.925 --> 49:32.344
Tell me. How much do you know, then?

49:32.970 --> 49:33.971
[Hocheol] Ju Haran?

49:34.847 --> 49:37.266
Ju Haran is a person you took care
of long ago.

49:38.642 --> 49:41.061
As soon as I gave you all her information
she went missing.

49:42.771 --> 49:43.856
Hmm.

49:44.899 --> 49:45.983
I remember.

49:47.693 --> 49:48.694
What about...

49:49.361 --> 49:50.362
...Kim Heeju?

49:56.494 --> 49:58.662
[Hocheol] You really know how
to sniff things out.

49:59.872 --> 50:03.042
You're like a fucking dog, Detective Kim.

50:04.210 --> 50:05.211
[lips smack]

50:05.878 --> 50:07.004
What are you talking about?

50:07.546 --> 50:08.547
Huh?

50:08.881 --> 50:10.090
Kim Heeju? Who's that?

50:11.967 --> 50:14.845
Ah. Yeah. Yangpo Airport.

50:14.929 --> 50:16.263
She's on the security team.

50:16.597 --> 50:18.641
Have you told Chairman
Ahn about Kim Heeju?

50:19.350 --> 50:22.269
You're here all by yourself,
so I bet you haven't, right?

50:24.021 --> 50:25.022
[Hocheol] Well, then.

50:26.649 --> 50:27.900
That means we have the same goal.

50:28.692 --> 50:29.985
What the hell are you saying?

50:30.694 --> 50:33.447
I just do what I'm told, Park.
You should already know that.

50:34.490 --> 50:36.784
The Chairman told me to find you
so that's what I'm doing.

50:37.451 --> 50:40.788
Whoever gets to Kim Heeju first gets all
the gold. Right?

50:41.830 --> 50:45.167
And the two of us are the only ones
who know that Kim Heeju has the gold.

50:45.876 --> 50:46.961
[exhales]

50:47.795 --> 50:49.213
Park, listen.

50:49.672 --> 50:52.508
I couldn't care less about who takes
the gold bars.

50:52.591 --> 50:54.260
I really don't give a shit.

50:54.343 --> 50:55.844
So one of us has to fucking die!

50:55.928 --> 50:58.597
[car engine revving]

50:58.681 --> 51:00.641
[crashing]

51:00.724 --> 51:03.644
[tires squealing]

51:08.607 --> 51:10.234
[breathing heavily]

51:10.317 --> 51:13.279
[Hocheol breathing erratically]

51:23.956 --> 51:26.875
[glass clinking]

51:26.959 --> 51:29.962
[engine rumbling]
STYLE
::cue()

51:48.731 --> 51:51.734
[distant sirens blaring]

51:52.985 --> 51:55.779
GANGWON SAEBAEK HOSPITAL

51:55.863 --> 51:58.866
[machines beeping]

52:06.415 --> 52:07.708
Geez, what happened to you?

52:07.791 --> 52:11.378
Huh? Oh, you're here.
Help me up. Shit.

52:11.754 --> 52:13.297
[groaning]

52:13.380 --> 52:14.798
Fuck me.

52:14.882 --> 52:17.051
[groaning]

52:17.676 --> 52:19.637
Look at me.
I almost died.

52:21.055 --> 52:22.306
What happened?

52:23.140 --> 52:24.975
Park, that fucking piece of shit,

52:25.059 --> 52:28.395
threatened to kill me and then he just
straight up rammed me with his car.

52:28.479 --> 52:29.647
-[Jinman] Dammit.
-What?

52:30.564 --> 52:32.232
[Jinman] Hey, by the way.

52:32.816 --> 52:34.401
What did you find out?

52:34.902 --> 52:37.363
You're the one who told Park about
the hospital.

52:37.446 --> 52:41.909
Yeah. He said it would settle
my Geumseong debts.

52:41.992 --> 52:43.118
[exhales sharply]

52:43.827 --> 52:44.828
[smacks lips]

52:50.042 --> 52:51.377
[Jinman] Listen.

52:51.460 --> 52:52.836
Once Park finds her...

52:53.962 --> 52:55.714
...Ju Haran is a dead woman.

52:56.674 --> 52:58.801
It doesn't matter if she has
the casket or not.

52:59.593 --> 53:01.720
He's gonna kill her either way.

53:02.638 --> 53:05.265
[Jinman] If you knew about that
and still helped Park find her...

53:07.101 --> 53:08.602
...then you shouldn't be a police officer.

53:09.895 --> 53:11.563
You're just an asshole.

53:12.064 --> 53:13.857
[Jinman] Park has no ties
to Geumseong anymore.

53:13.941 --> 53:15.275
He can't settle your debt.

53:15.901 --> 53:19.238
He's just doing whatever it takes
to find the casket and then get out.

53:23.992 --> 53:26.662
You know he killed Cheon, right?

53:28.163 --> 53:29.248
[Jinman] Chairman Ahn wants Park dead.

53:29.331 --> 53:32.126
And that's why his men are crawling
all over Jeongsan right now.

53:32.835 --> 53:33.836
Did you know that?

53:35.629 --> 53:37.005
I kinda knew, yeah.

53:37.089 --> 53:38.924
And you still said yes?

53:39.007 --> 53:40.134
[Jinman] Huh?

53:40.217 --> 53:42.386
Chairman Ahn is gonna catch Park soon,

53:42.469 --> 53:44.763
and when he does we both know
what's gonna happen.

53:46.473 --> 53:49.101
You think a dead man
can help settle your debt?

53:50.310 --> 53:51.311
[Jinman] How much was it?

53:52.104 --> 53:53.230
Around 100 million won?

53:54.064 --> 53:55.357
If I bring back the gold...

53:55.983 --> 53:57.526
...the Chairman's promised to pay me.

53:57.609 --> 53:59.278
[Jinman] I can settle your debt.

53:59.778 --> 54:00.946
Do you mean that?

54:01.029 --> 54:02.030
Want it in writing?

54:03.949 --> 54:05.325
[exhales]

54:05.409 --> 54:07.619
Wh--What am I supposed to tell Park?

54:07.703 --> 54:11.457
Just tell Park you're still looking
or something, 'kay?

54:12.040 --> 54:14.376
You just need to keep it vague, yeah?

54:15.252 --> 54:17.880
Hold him off until I get the casket back
to Chairman Ahn.

54:18.672 --> 54:21.842
Say whatever you need
to string him along, yeah?

54:22.134 --> 54:23.594
[Jinman] That son of a bitch Park...

54:24.428 --> 54:26.889
...he's definitely gonna die soon, got it?

54:27.556 --> 54:29.099
So you think this through.

54:29.183 --> 54:31.435
[inhales and exhales sharply]

54:31.518 --> 54:32.519
Okay.

54:32.603 --> 54:34.813
[breathing erratically]

54:41.236 --> 54:44.239
[light pained breathing]

54:54.500 --> 54:57.503
You're Yes Money guys, huh?

54:58.504 --> 54:59.505
Why are you here?

54:59.880 --> 55:01.048
[exhales]

55:01.131 --> 55:02.799
Well, it's a hospital, you know?

55:02.883 --> 55:04.593
We're all here to see the doctor.

55:05.511 --> 55:07.137
This is the oncology ward.

55:08.138 --> 55:09.348
You have cancer?

55:09.431 --> 55:10.891
Yeah.

55:11.934 --> 55:14.102
Oh, really? All of them, too?

55:16.021 --> 55:18.524
-Yeah.
-[groans]

55:19.316 --> 55:21.777
Give this message to Ko, 'kay?

55:22.903 --> 55:25.614
You have until the end of the day
to get all of your men outta here.

55:26.782 --> 55:30.619
Or I'll have to take everyone in
for obstruction of business. Got it?

55:30.702 --> 55:32.204
[breathing machine hissing]

55:32.287 --> 55:33.288
[grunts]

55:34.915 --> 55:35.916
Here?

55:42.839 --> 55:45.133
[groaning]

55:47.636 --> 55:49.096
[exhales]

55:54.268 --> 55:55.310
What?

56:07.823 --> 56:09.658
[water splashes]

56:10.409 --> 56:11.827
[Mija] Yeah, I got rid of it.

56:12.703 --> 56:13.912
What about the detective?

56:13.996 --> 56:15.831
[Mija] I told you.
He's not here.

56:15.914 --> 56:17.916
[inhales and exhales sharply]
STYLE
::cue()

56:18.417 --> 56:19.835
I'll be there soon, okay?

56:20.877 --> 56:22.170
[Heeju] Can you stay with her?

56:22.254 --> 56:23.964
At least until I get there?

56:24.047 --> 56:25.465
Okay.

56:26.383 --> 56:27.467
[exhales sharply]

56:27.551 --> 56:29.803
Are you really gonna move her
somewhere else?

56:29.886 --> 56:32.848
[Mija] Do we have to?
She's still unconscious.

56:32.931 --> 56:36.435
We got rid of the bug
so why not just keep her here?

56:36.518 --> 56:38.353
Won't the detective find her anyway?

56:38.437 --> 56:39.813
We can talk when I'm there.

56:39.896 --> 56:41.398
[Mija] Fine.

56:42.524 --> 56:43.525
[phone disconnects]

56:44.401 --> 56:47.404
[Woogy grunting]

56:48.030 --> 56:49.031
Hey.

56:49.573 --> 56:51.283
Just go to a doctor.

56:51.366 --> 56:52.492
Why would I do that?

56:55.454 --> 56:57.080
-Just go.
-[Heeju exhales sharply]

56:58.999 --> 57:00.917
[groans]

57:10.927 --> 57:13.221
Excuse me?

57:13.305 --> 57:15.223
Will you call Kim Heeju
and let her know I'm here?

57:16.516 --> 57:18.852
I need to talk to her.
Ask her to call me.

57:19.770 --> 57:22.314
K--Kim Heeju?

57:22.397 --> 57:25.525
I don't know anyone by that name.

57:26.234 --> 57:28.487
I don't have her number, either.
[chuckles]

57:29.237 --> 57:30.447
Mija.

57:31.490 --> 57:32.783
[Jinman] You really don't recognize me?

57:33.700 --> 57:35.535
I was stationed at Jeongsan.

57:35.619 --> 57:37.746
Kim Jinman.
I was a constable then.

57:40.123 --> 57:42.125
[Jinman] Well, it's been 30 years,
I guess.

57:43.418 --> 57:44.544
Don't you remember?

57:45.420 --> 57:47.839
Sunok and I lived together
for around a year.

57:47.923 --> 57:48.924
[Mija] Uh...

57:50.008 --> 57:51.176
[Jinman] You remember me, right?

57:51.259 --> 57:53.845
[chuckles nervously]

58:01.144 --> 58:02.145
[groans]

58:02.229 --> 58:03.271
[phone chimes]

58:03.772 --> 58:06.775
[phone trilling]

58:07.859 --> 58:10.862
[cell phone vibrating]

58:12.489 --> 58:14.449
-Yeah, Aunt Mija?
-[Mija] Heeju.

58:14.533 --> 58:17.285
- Detective Kim is here right now.
-What?

58:27.754 --> 58:29.047
Here you go.

58:29.131 --> 58:30.882
Heeju. There.

58:34.970 --> 58:35.971
[exhales]

58:39.099 --> 58:42.185
[door slides open and closed]

58:44.062 --> 58:45.063
Kim Heeju?

58:46.481 --> 58:48.233
It's Detective Kim Jinman.

58:49.109 --> 58:50.360
[Jinman] All right, then.

58:51.027 --> 58:53.363
You need to listen to me very carefully,
okay?

58:54.114 --> 58:57.075
Obviously, I know you have the casket.
And so does Park.

58:59.745 --> 59:02.622
You need to stay away from the hospital.

59:03.415 --> 59:06.293
[Jinman] I've got everything covered here
so don't worry about that.

59:08.295 --> 59:09.421
Listen, Kim Heeju.

59:12.048 --> 59:13.049
Park and I...

59:13.925 --> 59:17.554
...we're--we're really different, okay?

59:18.722 --> 59:21.516
Park is the kind of person who will stop
at nothing to find you.

59:22.350 --> 59:24.770
He's so much more evil
than anyone could even imagine.

59:24.853 --> 59:26.354
I really mean it, Heeju.

59:27.355 --> 59:29.608
[Jinman] You need to stop wasting time.

59:31.067 --> 59:33.987
Stop dragging this out and just tell
me where the casket is, Heeju.

59:35.280 --> 59:38.033
We need to return that thing
to Chairman Ahn.

59:38.116 --> 59:39.367
Today.

59:39.451 --> 59:41.244
[Woogy exhales]

59:41.328 --> 59:44.539
If you don't, Chairman Ahn
and Park Hocheol won't leave you alone.

59:45.123 --> 59:47.918
I'm telling you they won't ever
stop looking for you.

59:48.001 --> 59:50.212
[Jinman] Okay? Do you understand?

59:56.676 --> 59:58.261
[phone disconnects]
[Heeju] Hey.

59:58.345 --> 59:59.805
[phone disconnects]

01:00:04.476 --> 01:00:05.977
[pained exhale]

01:00:08.647 --> 01:00:11.650
[breathing machine hisses]

01:00:15.403 --> 01:00:16.404
Hey.

01:00:18.657 --> 01:00:19.825
Sunok.

01:00:21.743 --> 01:00:22.869
[Jinman] Yeo Sunok.

01:00:27.415 --> 01:00:29.042
I'll save your daughter, okay?

01:00:34.840 --> 01:00:36.925
[Jinman] So don't worry.
Just rest up.

01:00:37.050 --> 01:00:40.303
[groans]
Shit.

01:00:40.387 --> 01:00:41.388
Heeju.

01:00:44.766 --> 01:00:46.101
Should we do what he says?
STYLE
::cue()

01:00:48.562 --> 01:00:50.564
Should we just give
the chairman back his gold?

01:00:51.857 --> 01:00:53.024
[Woogy] He might be right.

01:00:53.984 --> 01:00:55.277
Maybe we should hand it all over.

01:00:55.652 --> 01:00:57.279
Before he finds out it's you.

01:00:58.071 --> 01:00:59.531
[Woogy] I think it'd be better that way.

01:01:02.450 --> 01:01:03.451
Heeju.

01:01:04.369 --> 01:01:05.912
You saw it yesterday.

01:01:07.414 --> 01:01:08.456
If they catch you...

01:01:09.833 --> 01:01:11.751
...the things they do
will be worse than death.

01:01:11.835 --> 01:01:15.046
Even if Detective Kim is really planning
to return the gold to Ahn,

01:01:15.130 --> 01:01:16.381
it's too late now.

01:01:17.173 --> 01:01:18.675
I gave half to Lee Dokyung.

01:01:19.384 --> 01:01:21.052
It's not possible to return it.

01:01:24.264 --> 01:01:26.224
[exhales]

01:01:31.605 --> 01:01:32.606
[clicks tongue]

01:01:42.282 --> 01:01:43.825
And besides.

01:01:46.202 --> 01:01:49.581
Do you really think you can give up
the gold now?

01:01:49.664 --> 01:01:53.209
[Heeju] Just return it and go back
to the way things were before?

01:01:56.212 --> 01:01:59.215
[♪ dramatic music]

01:02:01.134 --> 01:02:02.260
I know I can't.

01:02:04.763 --> 01:02:05.889
[exhales]

01:02:11.144 --> 01:02:14.147
[♪ music continues]

01:02:49.140 --> 01:02:52.143
[♪ dramatic music]

01:02:59.275 --> 01:03:03.905
[Male Singer] ♪ Another day another hour ♪

01:03:03.989 --> 01:03:08.284
♪ Free falling in my mind ♪

01:03:08.368 --> 01:03:15.375
♪ I will find all of the reasons
for leaving ♪

01:03:17.711 --> 01:03:22.799
♪ When everyone around me's changing ♪

01:03:22.882 --> 01:03:27.262
♪ Everyone but me ♪

01:03:27.345 --> 01:03:31.683
♪ All the things I thought I could be ♪

01:03:32.767 --> 01:03:35.228
♪ Are out of reach ♪

01:03:37.147 --> 01:03:41.735
♪ I leave it all behind ♪

01:03:41.818 --> 01:03:45.780
♪ As you fall in line ♪

01:03:45.864 --> 01:03:50.368
♪ I'm not expecting any light
at your door ♪

01:03:50.452 --> 01:03:52.120
♪ There's nothing left ♪

01:03:52.203 --> 01:03:58.460
♪ Just the pieces of everything
we could have been before ♪

01:03:58.543 --> 01:04:02.756
♪ Evermore ♪

01:04:02.839 --> 01:04:08.678
♪ I don't feel it like I used to ♪

01:04:08.762 --> 01:04:11.014
♪ Anymore ♪

01:04:23.651 --> 01:04:28.239
♪ You could find me in the dark ♪

01:04:28.323 --> 01:04:32.535
♪ Still calling through the night ♪

01:04:32.619 --> 01:04:37.499
♪ I leave behind all of the seasons ♪

01:04:37.582 --> 01:04:40.251
♪ I've dreamed of ♪

01:04:42.629 --> 01:04:49.552
♪ But the water's rising over
everything I've known ♪

01:04:49.636 --> 01:04:55.642
♪ Drifting out here all alone ♪

01:04:57.268 --> 01:05:01.356
♪ On your own ♪

01:05:01.439 --> 01:05:05.985
♪ So leave it all behind ♪

01:05:06.069 --> 01:05:10.448
♪ As you fall in line ♪

01:05:10.532 --> 01:05:12.367
♪ I'm not expect... ♪
